the payment : 

1. ChatGPT reserves ticket
2. Backend creates booking: reserved + unpaid
3. Email contains payment link
4. You open the payment link
5. Mock payment page shows “Pay Now”
6. You click “Pay Now”
7. Frontend calls backend payment endpoint
8. Booking becomes reserved + paid
9. Admin dashboard shows Paid

Payment processing is currently simulated for MVP demonstration purposes.
The architecture is designed to support future integration with real payment providers through webhook-based confirmation systems.

